<interface xmlns="http://zero-install.sourceforge.net/2004/injector/interface" uri="https://arcade.radicalgnu.xyz/Atari800.xml">
  <name>Atari800</name>
  <summary>portable and free Atari 8-bit emulator</summary>

  <description>
    Atari800 is the emulator of Atari 8-bit computer systems and 5200 
    game console for Unix, Linux, Amiga, MS-DOS, Atari TT/Falcon, 
    MS-Windows, MS WinCE, Sega Dreamcast, Android and other systems 
    supported by the SDL library. Our main objective is to create a 
    freely distributable portable emulator (i.e. with source code 
    available).
  </description>

  <homepage>https://atari800.github.io/</homepage>

  <feed-for interface="https://arcade.radicalgnu.xyz/Atari800.xml"/>

